   "locked": false,
   "text": "StaleObjectStateException → StaleStateException (\"Unexpected row count (expected row count 1 but was 0)\")\n0 행이면 이 예외가 난다는 점은 User Guide(Locking · 6.4)도 쓴다",
   "originalText": "StaleObjectStateException → StaleStateException (\"Unexpected row count (expected row count 1 but was 0)\")\n0 행이면 이 예외가 난다는 점은 User Guide(Locking · 6.4)도 쓴다",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
